  "interactionChecks": [
    "Check-in and undo apply immediately, update count, retain row focus and announce their outcome without a dialog",
    "Busy row is isolated; failed check-in retries from unchanged state; conflict shows current field and reloads",
    "Cancelled check-in is read-only; empty field retains policy without count; only entry kind, admission and check-in policy are locked",
    "Roster opens and returns focus; full-width layouts checked at 699, 700 and 1920 px; keyboard focus is visible"
  ],
  "limitations": "Static review fixtures: no backend, persistence, real concurrency or production accessibility certification. Busy states deliberately remain in progress. Capture toasts remain visible until dismissed for deterministic review."
}
